id: herculean-power
name: Herculean Power
talentCategory: super-stack
prerequisites: Hefty Muscle, Force Score of 12+
description: >
  Your godly might calls forth a wellspring of power in your strongest attacks.
text: >
  Herculean Power: Your godly might calls forth a wellspring of power in your strongest attacks.
  –Prerequisites: Hefty Muscle, Force Score of 12+
  (1)-[Passive]: If you would use a Signature Technique, apply the bonus from the first effect of Hefty Muscle twice to that Attacking Maneuver.
  (2)-[Passive]: All of your Ultimate Signature Techniques are Absolute Attacks.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Signature Technique, Physical or Energy, with Hefty Muscle held: its (1) once more on the Wound - a row of its own
# (chat.mjs woundParts).
allow herculean.signature;
# (2) An Ultimate Signature Technique: an Absolute Attack, unasked (chat.mjs postAttack).
allow herculean.ultimate;
